call: set_next_election_time

We have broken with the [+ chancellor +] government, and have voted against them in a vote of no confidence. The decree has still been enacted, but at the very least, we are spared from bearing the full brunt of its effects ending our association with the [+ chancellor +].

[? if bourgeois_parliament and not lvp_formed and not liberal_parliament: Fortunately, the propertied parliamentary group, with their leverage over Askew, has managed to persuade him to drop the decree! The group argues that the pause in War Loan payments have made the proposed cuts unnecessary, and that Askew should tone down his austerity measures. [? if bourgeois_parliament_ddp: Furthermore, the <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>'s presence in the parliamentary group has led Vice-Chancellor and Finance Minister Dietrich of the <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> to personally mitigate the severity of Askew's austerity measures.?]?][? if liberal_parliament: Fortunately, the liberal parliamentary group has allowed the liberal parties to combine their leverage over Askew, and persuade him to drop the decree!, The group argues that the pause in War Loan payments have made the proposed cuts unnecessary, and that Askew should tone down his austerity measures. [? if liberal_parliament and liberal_cooperation >= 8: Furthermore, the <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>'s Vice-Chancellor and Finance Minister Dietrich is able to personally mitigate the severity of Askew's austerity measures.?]?][? if lvp_formed: Fortunately, the <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>, using their leverage over Askew, has successfully persuaded him to drop the decree! The group argues that the pause in War Loan payments has made the proposed cuts unnecessary and that Askew should scale back his austerity measures. [? if lvp_leader == "Lytton": Furthermore, the <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>'s leader Hans Lytton is able to use his connections with Askew and the industrial community to influence his economic policy away from unrestrained austerity.?]?]

New elections have been set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year + 2365 +].

